b or by `nr_rx_branch_set_dispatch()`, which emits active branches only -- so their masks are correct bounded uses and are deliberately LEFT, with the invariant documented at all three places. Tree-wide grep for both masking idioms now returns only those two bounded uses plus `nr_passive_harq_tag.h:138`'s `%`, which round 1 already guarded at its single call site. All per-branch census arrays are diagnostic; no routing, data or report field was ever affected. NOT DONE: this does NOT remove AoA (P14 Stage B/C, which this task unblocks) and does NOT tag the remaining five CFR producers (P10 continuation) — so with >1 branch active those five still feed the lowest active engine as an attribution. G4 NOT passed |
